1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,950
LAN Party '98. A basement, six beige boxes and a 10BASE-T hub. Free in your browser.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:07,950
BUILDPC.EXE. Start at the computer shop with $1500: monitor, Pentium, RAM, drives, sound card, the lot.

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:11,950
Walk the basement. A real 3D room, shared live with everyone else who is online.

4
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:14,950
Sit at any free PC. A DOS machine boots in your browser, and everyone else can watch your game on the glass at your desk.

5
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:17,950
DOOM. 1994. IPXSETUP finds the other nodes by itself.

6
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:20,950
HERETIC. 1995. A magic wand and a lot of gargoyles. Up to four players.

7
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:23,950
HEXEN. 1995. Pick a class, find the portal, frag your mates.

8
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:26,950
QUAKE. 1996. Real 3D on a Pentium. Multiplayer, new game, wait for the others.

9
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:29,950
DESCENT. 1995. Six degrees of freedom and no floor. Start a network game.

10
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:32,950
DUKE NUKEM 3D. 1996. Episode one, now playable. Pick the network game in SETUP.

11
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:36,950
Deathmatch with mates. Host or join. Up to four PCs find each other over a virtual IPX network.

12
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:40,950
Then build it for real. Carry the parts to the back table, plug in every lead from behind, press the button and watch it POST.

13
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:44,950
Keep the night running. Coax drops out, so buy a hub. RAM from Singapore, overclocks, a pedestal fan, CD-ROM trays and a yellow extension lead to trip on.

14
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:48,950
A whole 98 desktop. Internet Explorer, #lanparty98 chat, LANamp, Snapster, Minesweeper, Solitaire and Downhill.

15
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:52,450
Pizza Shack, Volt Cola, a Nokka 51. Ring Pizza Shack and the driver knocks. Snacks have meters. The mobile has Snake.

16
00:00:52,500 --> 00:00:55,950
Couch, console, game shelf. A plaid couch, a four-player console, posters, a box for every game and a man taped to the ceiling.

17
00:00:56,000 --> 00:00:58,950
lanparty1998.com. Free in your browser. News, games and how to play at lanparty1998.com/news. Sign up for a party reminder.
